+
+## Agent tools
+
+The sign-in and sign-up forms expose `sign_in` and `sign_up` through the
+[WebMCP declarative API](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/declarative-api)
+in supporting browsers. Each tool is available on its respective page and takes
+required `username` and `password` fields. Invoking a tool submits the existing
+client-side form and returns `{ success, message }` after the API request finishes.
+Registration passwords must be at least eight characters and contain a number,
+as described by the form; the API validates the credentials.
+
+The forms remain usable in browsers without WebMCP support. No credentials or
+authentication tokens are included in tool results.
